{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obliterate tens of thousands of enemies who dared to challenge you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/5e8934e6d0beaf39368f693a5bf7184c.poster.avif?t=1759798713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/5e8934e6d0beaf39368f693a5bf7184c.webm?t=1759798713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/5e8934e6d0beaf39368f693a5bf7184c.mp4?t=1759798713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/ea6ffea9e1c94b2006ea21ff48dade1b.poster.avif?t=1759798713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/ea6ffea9e1c94b2006ea21ff48dade1b.webm?t=1759798713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/ea6ffea9e1c94b2006ea21ff48dade1b.mp4?t=1759798713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom loadout</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your class, equipment, upgrades and melees to discover each time new <strong>powerful synergies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry <strong>up to 11 weapons at once</strong> and improve them by eliminating <strong>ever stronger enemies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/equipments.gif?t=1759798713\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/classes.gif?t=1759798713\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>98</strong> power-ups,\u00a0<strong>30</strong> unlockable equipment and <strong>8</strong> artifacts weapons to build your <strong>OP</strong> loadout.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate all <strong>enemies</strong>, face <strong>mini-bosses,\u00a0</strong>and win by defeating the\u00a0<strong>Archon of Red.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different mini-bosses that teleport, grab you, summon enemies, and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 classes, each with 4 weapons to suit any playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15-minutes runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 difficulty levels, including <strong>One-Hit</strong> and <strong>Endless Survival</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect souls to unlock new power-ups and fragments to upgrade your weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy minerals scattered around the map for small stat bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-aim and manual fire, with faster movement when not shooting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through almost anything without taking damage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>familiars</strong> that automatically collect resources and attack enemies.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714400?t=1759798713","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/782d297b8a04f0abb35aa2664a279d4093855194/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759798713","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/96f079f71da326174874c31279ad7d98338d497f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759798713","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/96f079f71da326174874c31279ad7d98338d497f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759798713","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4029720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obliterate tens of thousands of enemies who dared to challenge you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/5e8934e6d0beaf39368f693a5bf7184c.poster.avif?t=1759798713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/5e8934e6d0beaf39368f693a5bf7184c.webm?t=1759798713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/5e8934e6d0beaf39368f693a5bf7184c.mp4?t=1759798713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a