 you, summon enemies, and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 classes, each with 4 weapons to suit any playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15-minutes runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 difficulty levels, including <strong>One-Hit</strong> and <strong>Endless Survival</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect souls to unlock new power-ups and fragments to upgrade your weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy minerals scattered around the map for small stat bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-aim and manual fire, with faster movement when not shooting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through almost anything without taking damage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>familiars</strong> that automatically collect resources and attack enemies.</p></li></ul>","developers":["TERMAX Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/856be379bddf561ef846f7a059d0308e465c231c/header.jpg?t=1759798713","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3714400/1366862183/ffcbc7155ca18e48459543ebac176100e68d9b5d/1759424199/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759426701","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3714400/1366862183/ffcbc7155ca18e48459543ebac176100e68d9b5d/1759424199/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759426701","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3714400/1366862183/ffcbc7155ca18e48459543ebac176100e68d9b5d/1759424199/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759426701","id":257138866,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257138866/movie480.mp4?t=1759426701","max":"https:/